    "title": "Meet Apparatus Engineer Jonathan Clinkscale - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Describe your role as an Apparatus Engineer. An Apparatus Engineer's first responsibility is safety of the crew. I'm responsible for getting us to every call safely. I'm responsible for checking the rig every day, making sure it's running properly, and making sure that it's ready for service. If there is a fire emergency, I make sure we have a positive water source to protect the crew inside trying to extinguish the fire. Read full article",
